      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "Since it was launched in 1963, it has featured a large number of pivotal texts on modern and post-modern architecture. Meanwhile, with 150 volumes, it is the most extensive book series in German on these topics.\n\nFor licensing reasons, access to this database is restricted to the domain ethz.ch."
